# ==============================================================================
# Noesis (Cognitive OS & AI Study Engine) — .gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# Nota:
# - `/build/` permanece ignorado por padrão (contém caches e artefatos pesados >100 MB).
# - `/releases/` é mantida versionada intencionalmente para distribuir os binários
#   oficiais prontos para download (APK Android Release e ZIP Desktop Windows).
# ==============================================================================

# Miscellaneous & OS
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.atom/
.build/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
.swiftpm/
migrate_working_dir/

# Secrets & Environment
.env
.env.*
*.jks
*.keystore

# IntelliJ / Android Studio / VS Code
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/
#.vscode/

# Flutter / Dart / Pub
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/
.widget_preview/

# Symbolication & Obfuscation
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio build artifacts
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Local tools, MCP & Supabase temporary state
.playwright/
.playwright-mcp/
supabase/.temp/
